{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368259530,"sessionID":"ses_e3779b549ffe1s1drsWQiTMkd6","part":{"id":"prt_1c8aec5a800131qAyp9k2Rirlz","messageID":"msg_1c8abbdb8001WVBs3YxuI50SRT","sessionID":"ses_e3779b549ffe1s1drsWQiTMkd6","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a multi-author blog: Flask JSON API under `/api` + React/TS Vite frontend with Tailwind, served together from one image on port 8000, SQLite data in `./data`.\n- Signed-in users publish/edit/delete own posts with tags; anyone reads; admin (username `admin`, password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`) toggles post take-down.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack/layout contract: backend entry `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`, `--pythonpath backend`), deps `backend/requirements.txt` + hash-locked `backend/requirements.lock`; frontend Vite project in `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`; Dockerfile at `/workspace/Dockerfile` copies `frontend/dist` next to backend; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`.\n- Post JSON shape: `id`, `title`, `content`, `tags`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `author`, `excerpt`. List: `{\"items\", \"total\", \"page\", \"page_size\"}`; query params `q`, `tag`, `author`, `page`, `page_size` (default page_size 10); newest first.\n- `excerpt` = first 200 chars with runs of line breaks collapsed to spaces (`blog.make_excerpt`). `updated_at` changes every update; omitted/null `tags` on PUT clears them. Taken-down posts: excluded from lists and 404 for everyone except admin (also 404 for edit/delete by author); admin list/detail still see them.\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` 201 `{\"username\"}`, dup → 409; `POST /api/auth/login` 200 `{\"token\"}`; `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; missing/bad token → 401; non-admin on admin route → 403. `admin` username reserved at registration; admin login disabled when `ADMIN_PASSWORD` unset/empty.\n- Validation errors return `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}` with 400; unknown `/api/*` paths return JSON 404 (not SPA fallback).\n- Stack pins: Flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0, Python 3.13, Node 24, React 19.3.1, Vite 8.3.5. Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` 4.3.5 (4.2.x rejects Vite 8; 4.2.4+/4.3.x accept `^8`), `tailwindcss` 4.3.5, `typescript` 5.9.3, `@types/react` 19.3.0, `@types/react-dom` 19.3.0 (19.3.2 doesn't exist).\n- Pip quirk: `-r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` fails (hashed constraints force `--require-hashes`, missing hashes). Local install works via `$HOME/venv/bin/pip install -r /workspace/backend/requirements.lock` (lock is a complete closure; `pip check` clean). Docker's own invocation in `Dockerfile` unchanged — do not assume it fails in the image.\n- Write tool cannot write outside `/workspace` (permission rules); venv lives at `$HOME/venv` (`/run/home/venv`); smoke tests live at `/workspace/.smoke/smoke.py`.\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only; only hand-written CSS is `frontend/src/index.css` containing `@import \"tailwindcss\";`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Dev env: frontend `npm ci` done, then `npm install -D --save-exact tailwindcss@4.3.5 @tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5 typescript@5.9.3 @types/react@19.3.0 @types/react-dom@19.3.0` (lock file updated); backend deps installed into `$HOME/venv`.\n- Backend fully implemented in `/workspace/backend/app.py`: SQLite schema (users, posts, post_tags, tokens), `init_db()` seeds admin from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at import, Bearer-token auth, register/login, posts CRUD with validation (`title is required`, `content is required`, `tags must be a list of strings`), paging with 400 on non-positive/non-int, case-insensitive `q` (LIKE w/ escaping on title+content), `tag` (case-insensitive), `author` (case-insensitive) filters, admin toggle endpoint, JSON 404 catch-all for `/api/<path:rest>`, SPA serving of `frontend/dist`.\n- `/workspace/.smoke/smoke.py` run: all ~88 checks passed (excerpt rules, ownership 403s, 401s, take-down visibility, paging, filters, admin-disabled case).\n\n### Active\n- Frontend implementation (todo \"Implement React frontend\" in progress). Files written so far:\n  - `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy to localhost:8000)\n  - `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `frontend/src/index.css`, `frontend/src/main.tsx` (StrictMode + CSS import)\n  - `frontend/src/api.ts` (`Post`, `PostListData`, `Auth`, `ApiError`, `loadAuth/saveAuth/clearAuth` in localStorage under `blog.token`/`blog.username`, `api<T>()` fetch helper, `formatDate`)\n  - `frontend/src/router.tsx` (`navigate`, `usePathname` on popstate + custom `app:navigate` event, `Link`)\n  - `frontend/src/App.tsx` (routes: `/`, `/login`, `/register`, `/new`, `/posts/{id}`, `/posts/{id}/edit`, NotFound; header with signed-in username + Sign out / Sign in + Register / New post)\n  - `frontend/src/pages/AuthPage.tsx` (register-then-login flow, shows API error messages)\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write remaining frontend pages: `frontend/src/pages/PostList.tsx` (list with title/author/date/excerpt/tags, search box `q`, `tag` + `author` filters, paging), `frontend/src/pages/PostPage.tsx` (content as plain text with paragraphs kept, admin take-down button, edit/delete for owner), `frontend/src/pages/Editor.tsx` (new + own-post edit, tag input, API validation messages, delete with confirmation).\n2. `cd /workspace/frontend && npx tsc --noEmit && npm run build`, then serve with gunicorn from `/workspace` (venv: `$HOME/venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`) and verify end-to-end: health, static serving, SPA fallback, login/CRUD/toggle over HTTP. Consider whether `frontend/package.json`'s hardcoded devDependency versions need syncing with the installed ones.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static serving (done, passing tests).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps; install from the lock directly locally.\n- `/workspace/.smoke/smoke.py`: 88-check API smoke suite, run with `$HOME/venv/bin/python`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`: deps incl. Tailwind 4.3.5 stack; lock updated.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css`, `src/main.tsx`: frontend scaffolding.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `src/router.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`: written frontend modules.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/PostList.tsx`, `PostPage.tsx`, `Editor.tsx`: still to be created.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data` persistent, gunicorn `app:app`).","time":{"start":1794368259496,"end":1794368259501}}}
