{"type":"text","timestamp":1794368275315,"sessionID":"ses_e3779b549ffe1s1drsWQiTMkd6","part":{"id":"prt_1c8af035a001m3RDR89ZpNLO4m","messageID":"msg_1c8aee399001awhd0oXZdocr4G","sessionID":"ses_e3779b549ffe1s1drsWQiTMkd6","type":"text","text":"Done — the app is complete and verified. Final state:\n\n- **Backend** (`backend/app.py`): full auth + posts CRUD + admin take-down, all 88 smoke checks pass\n- **Frontend** (`frontend/`): list w/ search/tag/author filters + paging, post page (owner edit/delete, admin toggle), new/edit editor with tag input, register/login — `tsc` + `vite build` clean\n- **End-to-end over HTTP** (gunicorn on :8000): SPA serving + fallback, JSON API 404s, register/login/create/filter/toggle/visibility, persistence across restart in `./data`\n- **Fixes**: Dockerfile now installs from `requirements.lock` (hashed constraints broke the old `-c` invocation in pip ≥25.1); README wording synced\n\nNo open next steps. Not committed (you didn't ask); `git status` shows the changes if you want a commit.","time":{"start":1794368275290,"end":1794368275293}}}
